{
  "_comment": "Single source of truth for who may write where. Read by scripts/check-ownership.mjs (pre-commit hook + CI) and scripts/setup-agent.sh (Claude Code deny rules). A path ending in / is a folder prefix; otherwise an exact file. HUMAN = only humans edit (agents must ask on the board).",
